This plugin ("youtube-source") bundles NewPipeExtractor, which is
licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 or later. The
plugin is therefore distributed under the same terms.

The host application that loads this plugin at runtime (vocal-monitor-
slim) treats every .dex as a separate work loaded dynamically through
its own classloader; the GPL terms apply to this plugin's source and
the bundled `.dex` artifact, not to the host application itself.

